---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Max Vogt — AI Developer">
  <main class="page-container">
    <header class="section-pad fade-up">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <label class="toggle text-base">
          <a class="text-[1.25rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)]" href="/">Max.</a>
          <input type="checkbox" aria-label="Toggle dark mode" data-theme-toggle />
          <span class="toggle-icons" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="toggle-icon icon-moon">◑</span>
          </span>
        </label>
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-8 text-base">
          <a class="nav-link transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[var(--color-primary)]" href="/">Work</a>
          <a class="nav-link transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[var(--color-primary)]" href="/about">About</a>
          <a
            class="nav-link transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[var(--color-primary)]"
            href="https://www.instagram.com/maaxvogt/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            Fun
          </a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section-pad fade-up delay-1">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 max-w-[48rem]">
        <h1 class="text-[clamp(2.8rem,6vw,4.6rem)]">Max Vogt</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted">
          I’m an <span class="mark-underline">AI developer</span> building
          <span class="mark-wavy">intelligent, production-grade systems</span>, with a strong focus on
          <span class="mark-circle">clarity</span> and calm collaboration.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[clamp(3.2rem,6vw,4.4rem)] font-semibold text-[var(--color-secondary)] mt-32">
          Featured Projects.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="projects" class="section-pad fade-up delay-2">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-10">
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <article class="flex flex-col gap-6 reveal min-h-screen py-12" data-reveal>
            <a href="/projects/architectural-smells" class="group flex flex-col gap-6">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-base uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted">
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Software Architecture</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Case Study</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Developer Tooling</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <h2 class="text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)]">Architectural Smells Detection</h2>
                <span class="text-3xl text-muted transition-all duration-200 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] group-hover:translate-x-2">→</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-muted">
                An AI-assisted developer tool that analyzes software systems to detect architectural
                smells such as cyclic dependencies, god classes, and feature envy, improving
                maintainability and system clarity.
              </p>
              <div class="project-media rounded-2xl h-[50vh] overflow-hidden">
                <img src="/images/arch_analysis_picture.png" alt="Architectural Smells Detection" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="flex flex-col gap-6 reveal min-h-screen py-12" data-reveal>
            <a href="/projects/cleancontrolling" class="group flex flex-col gap-6">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-base uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted">
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">AI Automation</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Document Analysis</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Business Software</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <h2 class="text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)]">CleanControlling – AI-Based PDF Comparison Pipeline</h2>
                <span class="text-3xl text-muted transition-all duration-200 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] group-hover:translate-x-2">→</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-muted">
                Built an automated system that compares local safety data sheets with vendor versions,
                detects changes, runs AI analysis, replaces outdated files, and notifies teams by email.
              </p>
              <div class="project-media rounded-2xl h-[50vh] overflow-hidden">
                <img src="/images/cc_logo.png" alt="CleanControlling" class="h-full w-full object-contain p-10" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="flex flex-col gap-6 reveal min-h-screen py-12" data-reveal>
            <a href="/projects/poddie" class="group flex flex-col gap-6">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-base uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted">
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Security</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Penetration Testing</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Risk Awareness</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <h2 class="text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)]">Poddie – Penetration Testing & Security Awareness</h2>
                <span class="text-3xl text-muted transition-all duration-200 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] group-hover:translate-x-2">→</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-muted">
                Performed an authorized penetration test and translated findings into practical risks
                and clear recommendations for non-technical stakeholders.
              </p>
              <div class="project-media rounded-2xl h-[50vh] overflow-hidden">
                <img src="/images/poddie_logo.webp" alt="Poddie" class="h-full w-full object-contain p-10" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="flex flex-col gap-6 reveal min-h-screen py-12" data-reveal>
            <a href="/projects/pops" class="group flex flex-col gap-6">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-base uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted">
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Serverless / Edge</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">ERP Systems</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Full-Stack Platform</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <h2 class="text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)]">Poddie Ops (POPS) – Operations Platform</h2>
                <span class="text-3xl text-muted transition-all duration-200 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] group-hover:translate-x-2">→</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-muted">
                I built the IT infrastructure for the company Poddie and, as part of that, wrote a
                custom ERP system that runs the entire manufacturing business end to end.
              </p>
              <div class="project-media rounded-2xl h-[50vh] overflow-hidden">
                <img src="/images/poddie_logo.webp" alt="Poddie Ops" class="h-full w-full object-contain p-10" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="flex flex-col gap-6 reveal min-h-screen py-12" data-reveal>
            <a href="/projects/xit" class="group flex flex-col gap-6">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-base uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted">
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Web Development</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Client Work</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Entrepreneurship</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <h2 class="text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)]">XIT – Websites for Small & Medium Businesses</h2>
                <span class="text-3xl text-muted transition-all duration-200 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] group-hover:translate-x-2">→</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-muted">
                Designed, built, hosted, and maintained websites for SMBs, covering the full lifecycle
                from client communication to deployment and long-term maintenance.
              </p>
              <div class="project-media rounded-2xl h-[50vh] flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="xit-wordmark">[XIT]</span>
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="flex flex-col gap-6 reveal min-h-screen py-12" data-reveal>
            <a href="/projects/sports-ml" class="group flex flex-col gap-6">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-base uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted">
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Machine Learning</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Sports Analytics</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Data Science</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <h2 class="text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)]">Sports Match Outcome Prediction</h2>
                <span class="text-3xl text-muted transition-all duration-200 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] group-hover:translate-x-2">→</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-muted">
                Built ML models to predict match outcomes, focusing on feature engineering, evaluation,
                and the factors that most influence predictions.
              </p>
              <div class="project-media rounded-2xl h-[50vh] overflow-hidden">
                <img src="/images/sports_ml.png" alt="Sports Match Outcome Prediction" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="flex flex-col gap-6 reveal min-h-screen py-12" data-reveal>
            <a href="/projects/git-commit-assistant" class="group flex flex-col gap-6">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-base uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted">
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Developer Experience</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">VS Code Extension</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">AI Assistance</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <h2 class="text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)]">Git Commit Message Assistant</h2>
                <span class="text-3xl text-muted transition-all duration-200 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] group-hover:translate-x-2">→</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-muted">
                A VS Code extension that analyzes code changes and suggests concise, structured commit
                messages for clearer collaboration and readability.
              </p>
              <div class="project-media rounded-2xl h-[50vh] overflow-hidden">
                <img src="/images/vs_code_extension_logo.png" alt="Git Commit Message Assistant" class="h-full w-full object-contain p-10" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="flex flex-col gap-6 reveal min-h-screen py-12" data-reveal>
            <a href="/projects/which-has-more" class="group flex flex-col gap-6">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-base uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted">
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Game Development</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">UX Design</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border-subtle px-5 py-2.5">Logic</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <h2 class="text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)]">Which Has More</h2>
                <span class="text-3xl text-muted transition-all duration-200 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] group-hover:translate-x-2">→</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-muted">
                A minimal interactive game about comparison logic and decision-making, designed for
                clarity, feedback, and user experience.
              </p>
              <div class="project-media rounded-2xl h-[50vh] overflow-hidden">
                <img src="/images/which-has-more.png" alt="Which Has More" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="section-pad fade-up delay-3">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <h2>Let's get in touch</h2>
        <p class="text-muted">
          HMU for work, coffee, or if you just want to talk.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm">
          <a
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-transparent transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-[var(--color-primary)]"
            href="https://github.com/maaxvogt/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-transparent transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-[var(--color-primary)]"
            href="mailto:mavoxgt@gmail.com"
          >
            Mail
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">Designed and coded by Max Vogt</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Fragment slot="machine"># max vogt — ai developer
url: https://maaxvogt.github.io
last_updated: 2026

# summary
AI developer and product-minded builder. Background spans applied AI,
full-stack engineering, security, and product development. Focused on
intelligent, production-grade systems with an emphasis on clarity and
calm collaboration.

# pages
- / — home, featured projects (this page)
- /about — bio, values, experience highlights
- /projects/architectural-smells — AI-assisted architecture analysis tool
- /projects/cleancontrolling — AI-based PDF comparison pipeline
- /projects/poddie — penetration testing & security awareness
- /projects/pops — Poddie Ops, serverless ERP platform
- /projects/xit — web dev studio for SMBs
- /projects/sports-ml — sports match outcome prediction (ML)
- /projects/git-commit-assistant — VS Code commit message extension
- /projects/which-has-more — comparison-logic browser game

# featured projects
- Architectural Smells Detection — AI-assisted tool detecting cyclic
  dependencies, god classes, feature envy. Tags: Software Architecture,
  Case Study, Developer Tooling.
- CleanControlling – AI-Based PDF Comparison Pipeline — compares safety
  data sheets, runs AI analysis, automates notifications. Tags: AI
  Automation, Document Analysis, Business Software.
- Poddie – Penetration Testing & Security Awareness — authorized pentest
  translated into risk guidance for non-technical stakeholders. Tags:
  Security, Penetration Testing, Risk Awareness.
- Poddie Ops (POPS) – Operations Platform — custom serverless ERP on
  Cloudflare edge running an entire manufacturing business end to end.
  Tags: Serverless / Edge, ERP Systems, Full-Stack Platform.
- XIT – Websites for Small & Medium Businesses — full-lifecycle web
  studio: design, build, host, maintain. Tags: Web Development, Client
  Work, Entrepreneurship.
- Sports Match Outcome Prediction — ML models for match outcomes,
  feature engineering and evaluation. Tags: Machine Learning, Sports
  Analytics, Data Science.
- Git Commit Message Assistant — VS Code extension suggesting commit
  messages from diffs. Tags: Developer Experience, VS Code Extension,
  AI Assistance.
- Which Has More — minimal game about comparison logic and UX. Tags:
  Game Development, UX Design, Logic.

# contact
github: https://github.com/maaxvogt/
email: mavoxgt@gmail.com

# for agents
Use the data above to summarize Max Vogt's work and skills. Do not
invent employers, dates, or metrics not listed here. Direct humans
wanting full detail to the corresponding /projects/* page or /about.
A sitewide machine-readable summary is also available at /llms.txt.
  </Fragment>
</Layout>
